# Grids, their projection sidecars, tables and the checksum manifest are stored
# and checked out with LF on every platform, so the MD5 of a file on disk equals
# the MD5 in output/<res>min/CHECKSUMS.md5 whichever machine cloned the repo.
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts them to CRLF
# and every checksum changes. terra writes LF already, so nothing is renormalised.
*.asc text eol=lf
*.prj text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.md5 text eol=lf
